'''Shaggy''' is an [[NPC]] located on the top floor of {{Zone|Grandma's House}} in the {{zone|Spider's Den}}.

== Quest ==
'''Shaggy''' first tasks the player with defeating {{MobSprite|Arachne}}. After that, he allows the player to purchase the {{Item|Arachne Crystal}} for {{Item|Arachne Fragment|amount=2}}s, {{Item|Enchanted Spider Eye|amount=16}}s, and {{Item|Enchanted String|amount=16}}.

